        teacherNotes: "welcomechild. 'todayisWeek 78 week AEIS secondary math, we learn Sec 2 G2.4 enlargement and reduction of a plane figure using a scale factor（use缩放比例进行平面图形放大 and 缩小）. this weekis G2.4 only, only teach平面图形放大 and 缩小: scale factor k > 1 = enlargement（放大）; 0 < k < 1 = reduction（缩小）. Centre of enlargement O（放大中心）: the fixed point. Image lengths = k × object lengths（像长度 = k × 物体长度）. Angles do NOT change（角度not变）. Integer object/image lengths only, no calculator（onlyuse整数边长, without calculator）. this weekdon't teach G2.5 solving simple problems involving similar figures（don't teach相似图形应useproblem）; don't teach G2.6 scale drawings（don't teach比例尺图）; don't teach G2.8 SSS/SAS tests（don't teach SSS/SAS 检验）; don't teach G2.9 ratio of areas = k²（don't teach面积比waitat k²）; don't teach G2.10 ratio of volumes = k³（don't teach体积比waitat k³）. this weekonly teach G2.4: enlargement and reduction using a scale factor (k > 1 放大, 0 < k < 1 缩小, centre O, image = k × object, angles unchanged).'Open screen share, play BoardWeike whiteboardexample problem（threeexample problem, each 2 min, total 6 min内complete）. Cast: secondary Wei, Aisha, Mr Lim at Riverside Secondary School. No calculator. Integer lengths only. this weekis几何week, 需need图解（画out物体 and 像, 标记 k and 中心点 O）. Week 78 weekcontinue G2 Congruence and similarity, 学习 2.4 enlargement and reduction.",
